  "prefLabel": "He-E 605.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 605.01 Purpose. In accordance with RSA 161-J, the purpose of these rules is to describe the “Standard Disclosure Summary” form that enables a prospective resident of an assisted living residence, independent living retirement community, or other housing for older persons to make informed choices and comparisons of the respective or prospective residential options.\n\nSource. #13443, eff 9-9-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-e600.html"
}
